  initialDialog:
  - "Hey, \nI didn't expect to meet any Goblin out here. \nI'm Gobsu, I am a member
    of Korara Tribe."
  - "I'm am supposed to Hunt food to Prove myself as a qualified warrior.  \nBut
    i didn't know that Hunting was so hard.\n"
  - "I'm trying to hunt for 2 days already.  \nBut I haven't caught anything yet.\nNow
    I'm too Hungry to move."
  - 'Please can you give me some food?


'
  acceptOption: Sure, I will help you.
  acceptAnswer: "Ohhh! Thank you! \nIf you can bring me 4 Raw Meat, it will be enough
    to feed me."
  declineOption: I'm sorry, I can't hunt as well.
  declineAnswer: 'Oh well, I guess this is where I dIe. '
  comebackAfterDecline: Ugh.... Im..soo...h..ungry...
  comebackInProgress: It is still not enough, make sure to sprint to chase them easily.
  comebackCompleted: "Ohhh! My savior! \n"
  finalWords: Nom! Nom! Nom! Nom!
